    "purpose": "Dial http.dialpkg 浏览器一致性画像的唯一比对基准",
    "baseline_browser": "Google Chrome 144.0.7559.132",
    "target_profile": "Chrome 稳定版 Windows/x64",
    "capture_os": "Linux (headless)",
    "capture_note": "TLS 栈 BoringSSL 跨平台同源：ClientHello 的 cipher/扩展/GREASE/groups/sig_algs/ALPN 在 Linux 与 Windows 上一致，故 TLS 段可直接复用为 Win/x64 基准。仅 HTTP 层的 Sec-CH-UA-Platform / UA 串按 Win/x64 写死（见 http_behavior.source）。",
